                                "sense_id": "e16f5a96-0c75-36a8-b333-3cee984dd189",
                                "text": "To render these stoppings effective, they must be built of brick or stone, and plastered with lime, and also supported at one or both sides by stowings of rubbish to provide against the effect of explosions."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "83489839-759a-3e85-bf34-55e562717814",
